{
  "title": "Hearty Harmonious Syrian Seafood Bisque",
  "description": "A sweet and silky Syrian seafood dish featuring seafood stock and ferment-kimchi, made with ayurvedic-tamasic-friendly ingredients. This bisque is an adventurous and flavorful twist on traditional Syrian cuisine.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
  "diet": [
